WEBVTT

00:06:59.081 --> 00:07:03.294
I do hours of research before diving
into a new territory,

00:07:03.294 --> 00:07:05.129
honoring people's culture,

00:07:05.171 --> 00:07:06.881
abiding by local laws.

00:07:07.882 --> 00:07:09.425
Asking permission,

00:07:09.467 --> 00:07:14.346
seeking informed consent
and not leading with my camera

00:07:14.388 --> 00:07:16.432
has been the foundation of my work.

00:07:17.433 --> 00:07:22.354
And this has helped me overcome
many hostile situations.

00:07:23.522 --> 00:07:27.234
While working on a project
called "Not My Shame,"

00:07:27.276 --> 00:07:31.530
documenting sexual violence
in my country, India,